WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.750
Sam wants to ask Lucía,
"What's your favourite colour?

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.710
" He knows the word for "what".

3
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:08.710
So he writes: ¿Qué es
tu color favorito?

4
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.410
Lucía understands him,

5
00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.850
but she would start the
question with a different word:

6
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.950
¿Cuál es tu color favorito?

7
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.670
In English, "what" works fine here.

8
00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.610
So why does Spanish reach
for a different word?

9
00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:24.310
In this mission, you'll wrap
questions in two question marks,

10
00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:25.660
one upside down.

11
00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:27.270
You'll learn the question words,

12
00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:30.080
and the written accent
every one of them carries.

13
00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.970
You'll put the words
in the right order,

14
00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:35.670
and learn which of the two
words to choose, and when.

15
00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:40.350
Your mission: find out why Lucía
changed Sam's question word.
